"A Towering Climb" is a fast paced, multiplayer climbing game where you compete against your friends to reach the top of a building as fast as possible.
To help you hinder your opponents, an array of abilities is at your disposal, like a sandwich throw or spilling beans on the building.

Prerequisit: Steam running with an active Steam account.

To play: Download all of the files, put all files into one folder, start up steam and click on the .exe file.

During the development process of "A Towering Climb" uses the Steam ID of "SpaceWars", which is spesifically provided by steam for such multiplayer testing purposes.

About the developer:
I have been working on this game for over one year now. I reworked it several times to match with my increasing skill level!
